  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 513.08 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before medicaid may be billed, in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139.\n\nSource. #10655, INTERIM, eff 8-15-14, EXPIRES: 2-11-15; ss by #10779, eff 2-11-15; ss by #10922, eff 9-1-15; ss by #11107, eff 7-1-16; ss by #12681, eff 11-27-18",
